% F-069-1 repro: cyclic `=` defined guard (X unified with s(X)).
% `=` is the self.glp defined guard `X? = X`; reducing `X = s(X?)` builds a
% self-referential substitution X -> s(X?). Pre-077: StackOverflow in
% PartialEvaluator.ApplySubstitution. Post-077: a CompileError diagnostic.
Wrap ::= s(Wrap) ; zero.
procedure loopy(Wrap).
loopy(X) :- X = s(X?) | true.
